      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.14.0</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Folders of small files move about 7× faster</b>, and large folder
      downloads no longer stop part-way.</li>
  <li><b>After a reconnect the file list comes back</b> to the folder you were
      in, instead of saying "not connected".</li>
  <li><b>Agents can propose a command</b> — it appears as a card in the pane and
      runs only when you press Run.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
